Package: ipmifanctl
Version: 1.0.0-1
Architecture: all
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Tim Hosking <munger@mungerware.com>
Depends: ipmitool
Description: Dell PowerEdge fan speed control via IPMI
 Provides the ipmifanctl command for controlling fan speed on Dell
 PowerEdge servers via ipmitool raw commands. Disables automatic
 thermal management and sets fan to a specified percentage (5-100%).
